flex h-fit w-fit shrink-0 rounded-card outline-none focus-visible:shadow-focus"><div data-cds="Card" data-size="xs" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[''] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)] max-w-full [--cds-ring-color:var(--cds-border-strong)] [--cds-ring-inner:var(--cds-ring-hairline)] [--cds-ring-outer:0px]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit] shadow-field-drop"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div data-cds="CardMedia" data-cds-tile-media="" class="self-stretch -mx-pad-lg overflow-hidden first:-mt-pad-lg first:rounded-t-card first:not-only:border-b last:-mb-pad-lg last:rounded-b-card last:not-first:border-t flex"><span data-cds="CardLink" role="button" tabindex="0" class="cds-reset outline-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-card after:content-[''] after:pointer-events-none flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center justify-center self-stretch cursor-zoom-in"><canvas aria-hidden="true" width="1568" height="663" data-cds-tile-picture="" data-loaded="" class="block transition-opacity duration-base motion-reduce:transition-none opacity-100"></canvas><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 block size-full rounded-card object-contain transition-opacity duration-base motion-reduce:transition-none opacity-0" src="blob:https://claude.ai/5874c5fa-e2a5-4a0e-806a-06d01e59c6e2"><span class="sr-only">1793729292654_image.png</span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs rounded-[var(--cds-message-bubble-radius)] px-[var(--cds-message-bubble-pad-x)] py-[var(--cds-message-bubble-pad-y)] text-heading font-normal break-words select-text text-primary max-w-[var(--cds-message-bubble-measure)] bg-[var(--cds-bg-user-message)]"><div id="_r_2kg_" class=""><div class="cds-user-message-body"><div id="_r_9g_01a1a299-1f29-7c49-ba8e-bfa97aef349e" data-testid="user-message" class="relative grid min-w-0 grid-cols-1 gap-2"><div class="contents [&amp;_ol]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ol]:ps-8 [&amp;_ul]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ul]:ps-8 [--msg-block-radius:initial]"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">why readme file is showing like this ?</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="user-message-actions" data-cds="MessageActions" data-deferred="" data-size="xs" class="flex items-center select-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-control w-px"></span><button type="button" class="sr-only" aria-label="Show message actions for You said: why readme file is showing like this ?"></button></div></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only" data-find-omitted="" data-testid="failed-send-status-region"></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="41" data-index="41" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="4" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="46" aria-posinset="42" aria-label="Message 42 of 46"><div class="contents" data-mini-claude-message="_r_9f_"><div data-transcript-row="" class="mt-xs [&amp;&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty))]:pb-md [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty))]:pb-md"><div data-reply-scope="" class="group group/message-row min-w-0" style=""><div data-cds="AssistantMessage" data-cds-reply-type="" class="group/message-row relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs break-words select-text print:block" data-testid="assistant-message" data-turn-key="01a1a299-1f29-736f-b47b-952f5801094a" data-is-streaming="false" id="_r_9g_01a1a299-1f29-736f-b47b-952f5801094a"><h3 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: The README is showing as raw text because the file is not named README.md.</h3><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-5 compact:gap-4 print:block print:[&amp;&gt;:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-5 compact:print:[&amp;&gt;:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-4"><div class="min-w-0" style=""><div class="grid grid-cols-1 content-start gap-5 compact:gap-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!my-0 print:block print:before:table print:before:-mb-5 print:[&amp;&gt;*]:!mt-5 print:[&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!mt-5"><div data-transcript-engine-root="" class="contents"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose stacks:[&amp;_li:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))::marker]:[--cds-text-secondary:var(--cds-text-primary)]" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block"><p dir="ltr">The README is showing as raw text because the file is not named <strong><code dir="ltr">README.md</code></strong>. GitHub only turns the formatting into a nice page when the file name ends in <code dir="ltr">.md</code>. Yours is most likely named just <code dir="ltr">README</code> or <code dir="ltr">README.txt</code>, so GitHub treats it as plain text. The content itself is fine.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>How to fix it (rename on GitHub)</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>Open your repo’s main page.</li>
<li>In the file list, click the README file (it may be called <code dir="ltr">README</code> or <code dir="ltr">README.txt</code>).</li>
<li>Click the <strong>pencil icon</strong> (top right of the file) to edit it.</li>
<li>At the top, find the file name box next to your repo name.</li>
<li>Change the name to exactly <strong><code dir="ltr">README.md</code></strong> (capital letters <code dir="ltr">README</code>, then <code dir="ltr">.md</code>).</li>
<li>Click the green <strong>Commit changes...</strong> button, then <strong>Commit changes</strong> again.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">Refresh the repo page, and the README will show with the centered title, colored badges, and screenshot.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>If you have two README files</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">If the file list shows both <code dir="ltr">README</code> and <code dir="ltr">README.md</code>, delete the wrong one. Open it, click the three dots (<strong>...</strong>) at the top right, choose <strong>Delete file</strong>, and commit.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>If the screenshot doesn’t appear after fixing</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">The image link in the README is <code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code>, so that file must be in the same folder as <code dir="ltr">README.md</code>. In your repo’s file list, check that <code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code> is there. If it isn’t, click <strong>Add file → Upload files</strong>, upload it, and commit.</p>
<p dir="ltr">A quick way to check the name: the file list on your repo page should show <code dir="ltr">README.md</code> with the <code dir="ltr">.md</code> at the end. If you can’t tell what it’s called, send me a screenshot of the file list and I’ll point to the exact file.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] touch:has-[&gt;[data-size=xs]&gt;:first-child:not(time)]:ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_0.625rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] print:mt-xs"><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none touch:flex-wrap touch:[--cds-h-control--xs:calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:h-auto touch:min-h-[calc(1.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:gap-y-[calc(0.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:*:-my-[calc(0.25rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary stacks:[&amp;_button:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-plain-secondary)]!" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))]