ne focus-visible:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-fill-accent)] focus-visible:outline-hidden select-none" style="--cds-outset-x: var(--cds-pad-xs);" data-cds-row=""><span id="_r_2de_-text" class="flex min-w-0 gap-xs items-center"><span id="_r_2de_-label" class="group/morph inline-grid items-center justify-items-start data-[gliding]:overflow-x-clip min-w-0 max-w-full stacks:box-content stacks:ps-[var(--cds-outset-x)] stacks:ms-outset" style="--cds-outset-x: min(calc(var(--cds-pad-sm) + 0.5px), calc(12px - 3.5px));"><span data-morph-key="done|Read a page, ran a command, shared files" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center group-data-[gliding]/morph:max-w-none"><span dir="auto" class="min-w-0 overflow-x-clip text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap py-[0.125em] -my-[0.125em] text-secondary group-hover/status:text-secondary group-has-[:focus-visible]/status:text-secondary [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] supports-[text-align:match-parent]:[text-align:match-parent]">Read a page, ran a command, shared files</span></span></span></span><button type="button" data-cds-row-toggle="" class="cds-reset -ms-1 inline-flex h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center self-start border-0 bg-transparent p-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden static justify-center after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded after:content-[''] after:transition-shadow after:duration-fast focus-visible:after:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-fill-accent)]" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" aria-labelledby="_r_2de_-label" aria-owns="_r_2de_-label"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex h-[1lh] items-center justify-center text-secondary transition-transform duration-fast motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover/status:text-secondary group-has-[:focus-visible]/status:text-secondary" style="translate: 0px 0.5px;"><span data-cds="Icon" data-cds-mirror="" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(0.75rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 577.8;"></span></span></button></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Read a page, ran a command, shared files</span></div><div class="min-w-0" style=""><div class="grid grid-cols-1 content-start gap-5 compact:gap-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!my-0 print:block print:before:table print:before:-mb-5 print:[&amp;&gt;*]:!mt-5 print:[&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!mt-5"><div data-transcript-engine-root="" class="contents"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose stacks:[&amp;_li:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))::marker]:[--cds-text-secondary:var(--cds-text-primary)]" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block"><p dir="ltr">I looked at your repo, and I can’t change files on your GitHub account myself. But I found exactly what’s wrong, and I’ve updated the files so you only need to upload them.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>What I found</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>Your README file is named <strong><code dir="ltr">README.txt</code></strong>, and GitHub only formats files ending in <code dir="ltr">.md</code>. That’s why it looks like raw text.</li>
<li><strong><code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code> is not in your repo</strong>, so the image would show as broken even after the rename.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>What I changed in the README</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">I filled in your real repo address (<code dir="ltr">https://github.com/Zeeshan608/My-chatbot.git</code>) and added a GitHub badge with your profile link in the author section. Everything else is the same.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>Fix it in 3 steps (click by click)</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>Step 1: Delete the old file</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>Open your repo and click <strong>README.txt</strong>.</li>
<li>Click the three dots <strong>...</strong> at the top right of the file.</li>
<li>Click <strong>Delete file</strong>, then click <strong>Commit changes</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>Step 2: Upload the new files</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>Download <code dir="ltr">README.md</code> and <code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code> from the cards above.</li>
<li>On your repo’s main page, click <strong>Add file → Upload files</strong>.</li>
<li>Drag both files into the box, or click <strong>choose your files</strong>.</li>
<li>Scroll down and click <strong>Commit changes</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>Step 3: Check it</strong><br>
Refresh your repo page. You should see <code dir="ltr">README.md</code> and <code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code> in the file list, and the README below should show the centered title, colored badges, and your screenshot.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>One more thing before you finish</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr">Your screenshot shows the default model as <code dir="ltr">gemini-nano-banana-2.1</code>, which is an image model and won’t chat. After you add <code dir="ltr">"banana"</code> to the <code dir="ltr">SKIP</code> list in <code dir="ltr">app.py</code> (as I described in my last message), the dropdown will show chat models, and you can retake the screenshot and upload it again with the same name to replace it.</p></div></div><div data-testid="file-card-stack" class="flex flex-col gap-2 ps-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)]"><div data-transcript-stays-put=""><div data-cds="Card" data-testid="file-card-block" data-file-row-card="" data-cds-bubble-stack-item="" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[''] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)] w-full max-w-130"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit] text-tint-blue bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_4%,var(--cds-surface-1))] dark:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_8%,var(--cds-surface-1))]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div class="flex items-center font-sans"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-sm"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-[calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-chip text-tint-blue bg-tint-blue"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span><div class="flex h-[calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center"><div c