"sr-only" data-find-omitted="" data-testid="failed-send-status-region"></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="45" data-index="45" data-testid="transcript-row" data-last-message="true" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="0" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="46" aria-posinset="46" aria-label="Message 46 of 46"><div class="contents" data-mini-claude-message="_r_9f_"><div data-transcript-row="" class="mt-xs [&amp;&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty))]:pb-md [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty))]:pb-md"><div data-reply-scope="" class="group group/message-row min-w-0" style=""><div data-cds="AssistantMessage" data-cds-reply-type="" class="group/message-row relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs break-words select-text print:block" data-testid="assistant-message" data-turn-key="01a1a2a2-0d58-7118-8bc6-284e4975447a" data-is-streaming="false" id="_r_9g_01a1a2a2-0d58-7118-8bc6-284e4975447a"><h3 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: Don't commit yet.</h3><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-5 compact:gap-4 print:block print:[&amp;&gt;:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-5 compact:print:[&amp;&gt;:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-4"><div class="min-w-0" style=""><div class="grid grid-cols-1 content-start gap-5 compact:gap-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!my-0 print:block print:before:table print:before:-mb-5 print:[&amp;&gt;*]:!mt-5 print:[&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!mt-5"><div data-transcript-engine-root="" class="contents"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose stacks:[&amp;_li:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))::marker]:[--cds-text-secondary:var(--cds-text-primary)]" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block"><p dir="ltr"><strong>Don’t commit yet.</strong> The files are right, but their names are wrong:</p>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><code dir="ltr">README (4).md</code> must be <strong><code dir="ltr">README.md</code></strong></li>
<li><code dir="ltr">screenshot (1).png</code> must be <strong><code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code></strong></li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr">Your browser added the “(4)” and “(1)” because you downloaded the files more than once. With these names, GitHub won’t show the README as a formatted page, and the image link (<code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code>) won’t find your screenshot.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>Fix it</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>On this upload page, click the <strong>X</strong> next to both files to remove them.</li>
<li>Open the folder on your computer where they were downloaded.</li>
<li>Right-click <code dir="ltr">README (4).md</code>, choose <strong>Rename</strong>, and change it to <code dir="ltr">README.md</code>.</li>
<li>Right-click <code dir="ltr">screenshot (1).png</code>, choose <strong>Rename</strong>, and change it to <code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code>.</li>
<li>If Windows says a file with that name already exists, delete the older copies first.</li>
<li>Back on the GitHub upload page, drag the two renamed files in again.</li>
<li>Check that the list now shows exactly <code dir="ltr">README.md</code> and <code dir="ltr">screenshot.png</code>.</li>
<li>Scroll down and click the green <strong>Commit changes</strong> button.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">If Windows hides the <code dir="ltr">.md</code> and <code dir="ltr">.png</code> endings, the rename can accidentally create <code dir="ltr">README.md.txt</code>. To avoid that, open File Explorer, click <strong>View → Show → File name extensions</strong>, and then rename.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Also make sure you deleted the old <code dir="ltr">README.txt</code> from the repo, otherwise GitHub may show that one instead. After committing, refresh your repo page. The README should appear with the centered title, badges, and screenshot.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] touch:has-[&gt;[data-size=xs]&gt;:first-child:not(time)]:ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_0.625rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] print:mt-xs"><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none touch:flex-wrap touch:[--cds-h-control--xs:calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:h-auto touch:min-h-[calc(1.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:gap-y-[calc(0.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:*:-my-[calc(0.25rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary stacks:[&amp;_button:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-plain-secondary)]!" data-testid="message-actions" data-always-visible=""><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px