v style=""><div class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 [&amp;_&gt;_*:last-child]:mb-0 print:block print:[&amp;_&gt;_:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-3 font-claude-response">&lt;div align="center"&gt;
<h1 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="3:1-3:22;22-43">✨ Nova AI Assistant</h1>

<h3 dir="ltr" class="mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="5:1-5:81;45-125">A fast, elegant AI chatbot powered by Google Gemini and built with Streamlit</h3>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" data-sourcepos="7:1-10:139;127-673"><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://my-chatbot-804.streamlit.app/"><span>Live Demo</span></a>
<a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.python.org/"><span>Python</span></a>
<a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://streamlit.io/"><span>Streamlit</span></a>
<a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://ai.google.dev/"><span>Gemini</span></a></p>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="12:1-12:65;675-739"><strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://my-chatbot-804.streamlit.app/">👉 Try Nova AI Live</a></strong></p>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" data-sourcepos="14:1-14:38;741-778"><span>Nova AI Screenshot</span></p>

&lt;/div&gt;
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="20:1-20:24;793-816">📖 About the Project</h2>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="22:1-22:274;818-1091"><strong>Nova AI</strong> is a modern, responsive chatbot that lets you talk to Google's Gemini models through a clean, professional interface. It streams answers in real time, lets you switch between different AI models and personas on the fly, and keeps your API key completely secret.</p>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="24:1-24:124;1093-1216">Whether you want to write an email, learn a concept, debug Python code, or brainstorm startup ideas, Nova is ready to help.</p>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="28:1-28:19;1223-1241">🌟 Key Features</h2>

<div dir="ltr" class="md-table-scroll overflow-x-auto w-full mb-6 print:overflow-x-visible" data-sourcepos="30:1-43:99;1243-2489" style=""><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold text-start">Feature</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold text-start">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">⚡ <strong>Real-time streaming</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Answers appear word by word as they are generated, with a live typing cursor</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🤖 <strong>Multiple AI models</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Choose from the Gemini models available to your API key, picked from a dropdown</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🔄 <strong>Auto-updating model list</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">The app asks Google which models are currently available, so it keeps working when models are renamed or retired</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🎭 <strong>Switchable personas</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">General Assistant, Professional Writer, Coding Mentor, and Study Tutor</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🎚️ <strong>Creativity control</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">A slider adjusts the temperature from precise to highly creative</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">💬 <strong>Conversation memory</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">The full chat history is sent with every request, so Nova remembers the context</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🚀 <strong>Quick-start prompts</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">One-click suggestion cards to begin a conversation instantly</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">⬇️ <strong>Download chat</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Save the whole conversation as a text file</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🗑️ <strong>New chat button</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Clear the conversation and start fresh</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🎨 <strong>Custom dark UI</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Gradient glow background, glass-style chat bubbles, and a polished sidebar</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🔐 <strong>Secure by design</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">The API key is never written in code or uploaded to GitHub</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">🛡️ <strong>Clear error messages</strong></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Real API errors are displayed, which makes troubleshooting easy</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="47:1-47:19;2496-2514" style="">⚙️ How It Works</h2>

