 │  User types  │ ──▶ │   Streamlit app   │ ──▶ │  Google Gemini   │
 │  a message   │     │ (app.py + CSS UI) │     │       API        │
 └──────────────┘     └───────────────────┘     └──────────────────┘
        ▲                       │                         │
        │                       ▼                         │
        │            ┌───────────────────┐                │
        └─────────── │  Streamed reply   │ ◀──────────────┘
                     │  shown live in UI │
                     └───────────────────┘</code></pre></div></div>

<ol dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 ps-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" data-sourcepos="62:1-67:87;3127-3828" style="">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="62:1-62:109;3127-3235"><strong>Secure startup:</strong> the app reads <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">GEMINI_API_KEY</code> from Streamlit secrets and connects to the Gemini API.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="63:1-63:180;3236-3415"><strong>Model discovery:</strong> it fetches the list of chat models your key can use and fills the <strong>Model</strong> dropdown (Flash models first, since they are faster and work on the free tier).</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="64:1-64:73;3416-3488"><strong>You send a message:</strong> your message is added to the session history.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="65:1-65:145;3489-3633"><strong>The request is built:</strong> the full conversation, the chosen persona (as a system instruction), and the creativity setting are sent to Gemini.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="66:1-66:108;3634-3741"><strong>Streaming response:</strong> Gemini sends the answer in small chunks, and Nova displays each chunk instantly.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="67:1-67:87;3742-3828"><strong>Memory kept:</strong> the finished reply is saved to the chat history for the next turn.</li>
</ol>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="71:1-71:18;3835-3852" style="">🛠️ Tech Stack</h2>

<ul dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 ps-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" data-sourcepos="73:1-78:38;3854-4153" style="">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="73:1-73:23;3854-3876"><strong>Language:</strong> Python</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="74:1-74:52;3877-3928"><strong>Framework:</strong> <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://streamlit.io/">Streamlit</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="75:1-75:81;3929-4009"><strong>AI:</strong> <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://ai.google.dev/">Google Gemini API</a> via the <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">google-genai</code> SDK</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="76:1-76:65;4010-4074"><strong>Styling:</strong> Custom CSS (Inter font, gradients, glassmorphism)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="77:1-77:41;4075-4115"><strong>Hosting:</strong> Streamlit Community Cloud</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="78:1-78:38;4116-4153"><strong>Version control:</strong> Git and GitHub</li>
</ul>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
