</span><span><span style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">pip</span> <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">install</span> <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">-r</span> <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">requirements.txt</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="114:1-114:24;4977-5000"><strong>3. Add your API key</strong></p>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="116:1-116:109;5002-5110">Get a free key from <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://aistudio.google.com/">Google AI Studio</a>, then create <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.streamlit/secrets.toml</code>:</p>

