 class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span><span style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">streamlit</span> <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">run</span> <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">app.py</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="125:1-125:48;5215-5262">Open <strong><a class="underline [&amp;:where(:dir(rtl))]:after:content-['\200E'] underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="http://localhost:8501/">http://localhost:8501</a></strong> in your browser.</p>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="129:1-129:32;5269-5300">☁️ Deploy on Streamlit Cloud</h2>

<ol dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 ps-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" data-sourcepos="131:1-134:51;5302-5591">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="131:1-131:77;5302-5378">Push this project to GitHub (the <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.gitignore</code> already protects your key).</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="132:1-132:85;5379-5463">Go to <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://share.streamlit.io/">share.streamlit.io</a> and click <strong>Create app</strong>.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="133:1-133:77;5464-5540">Select your repository, the <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">main</code> branch, and <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">app.py</code> as the main file.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="134:1-134:51;5541-5591">Open <strong>Advanced settings → Secrets</strong> and paste:</li>
</ol>

<div role="group" aria-label="toml code" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="135:1-137:4;5592-5643" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md pointer-coarse:backdrop-blur-md [@media(hover:none)]:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-testid="code-block-copy" id="_r_2e0_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="text-secondary text-caption-regular font-sans p-3.5 pb-0">toml</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-toml" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span>   GEMINI_API_KEY <span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">=</span> <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"your-api-key-here"</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>

<ol dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 ps-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" start="5" data-sourcepos="138:1-138:74;5644-5717">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="138:1-138:74;5644-5717">Click <strong>Deploy</strong>. Every <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">git push</code> updates the live app automatically.</li>
</ol>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="142:1-142:15;5724-5738">🔐 Security</h2>

<ul dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 ps-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" data-sourcepos="144:1-146:80;5740-6015">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="144:1-144:113;5740-5852">The API key is stored only in <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.streamlit/secrets.toml</code> locally and in the Streamlit Cloud Secrets box online.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="145:1-145:83;5853-5935"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">secrets.toml</code> is listed in <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.gitignore</code>, so it is <strong>never uploaded</strong> to GitHub.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="146:1-146:80;5936-6015">If a key is ever exposed, delete it in Google AI Studio and create a new one.</li>
</ul>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="150:1-150:22;6022-6043">🧩 Troubleshooting</h2>

<div dir="ltr" class="md-table-scroll overflow-x-auto w-full mb-6 print:overflow-x-visible" data-sourcepos="152:1-157:89;6045-6430"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold text-start">Problem</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold text-start">Solution</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">API key not found</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Check that the secret is named exactly <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">GEMINI_API_KEY</code></td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">404 NOT_FOUND</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">The model was retired, so choose another one from the dropdown</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Free quota reached, so switch to a Flash model or try again later</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Slow first response</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top">Pro models think longer, so choose a Flash or Flash-Lite model</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5" style="">
<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="161:1-161:26;6437-6462">🔮 Future Improvements</h2>

<ul dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 ps-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" data-sourcepos="163:1-167:29;6464-6627">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="163:1-163:34;6464-6497">🔑 Password or login protection</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="164:1-164:27;6498-6524">📎 File and image upload</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="165:1-165:44;6525-6568">💾 Permanent chat history with a database</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="166:1-166:30;6569-6598">🌐 Multi-language interface</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words ps-2" data-sourcepos="167:1-167:29;6599-6627">🎙️ Voice input and output</li>
</ul>

